{"title":"잔혹한 천사의 테제","artist":"사토 히데토시","sourceId":"reference:eU4TTAaulge5K3FNtSYO","sourceHash":"8e987ecad96fe13e6fb94eeefb8781bd5244b06848a09b2a1d1cc47617fa34de","performanceStatus":"reference_timing","timingMethod":"reference_lrc_unverified","reviewStatus":"draft","cue_timing_confirmed":false,"timingWarning":"(주의) 노래와 함께 타이밍 검증되지 않았음","referenceProvider":"LRCLIB","referenceId":34676145,"cues":[{"id":"1","start":0.15,"end":6.95,"text":"残酷な天使のように","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"2","start":6.95,"end":15.3,"text":"少年よ 神話になれ","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"3","start":22.58,"end":29.42,"text":"蒼い風がいま 胸のドアを叩いても","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"4","start":29.42,"end":33.23,"text":"私だけをただ見つめて","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"5","start":33.23,"end":37.33,"text":"微笑んでるあなた","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"6","start":37.33,"end":44.68,"text":"そっとふれるもの もとめることに夢中で","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"7","start":44.68,"end":52.33,"text":"運命さえまだ知らない いたいけな瞳","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"8","start":52.33,"end":59.7,"text":"だけどいつか気付くでしょう その背中には","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"9","start":59.7,"end":67.12,"text":"遥か未来 めざすための羽根があること","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"10","start":67.12,"end":71.23,"text":"残酷な天使のテーゼ","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"11","start":71.23,"end":74.78,"text":"窓辺からやがて飛び立つ","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"12","start":74.78,"end":78.47,"text":"ほとばしる熱いパトスで","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"13","start":78.47,"end":82.25,"text":"思い出を裏切るなら","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"14","start":82.25,"end":85.99,"text":"この宇宙を抱いて輝く","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"15","start":85.99,"end":91.12,"text":"少年よ 神話になれ","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"16","start":134.83,"end":142.48,"text":"ずっと眠ってる 私の愛の揺りかご","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"17","start":142.48,"end":149.96,"text":"あなただけが 夢の使者に呼ばれる朝がくる","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"18","start":149.96,"end":156.85,"text":"細い首筋を 月あかりが映してる","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"19","start":156.85,"end":164.43,"text":"世界中の時を止めて 閉じこめたいけど","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"20","start":164.43,"end":171.95,"text":"もしもふたり逢えたことに意味があるなら","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"21","start":171.95,"end":179.54,"text":"私はそう 自由を知るためのバイブル","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"22","start":179.54,"end":183.3,"text":"残酷な天使のテーゼ","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"23","start":183.3,"end":186.96,"text":"悲しみがそしてはじまる","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"24","start":186.96,"end":190.57,"text":"抱きしめた命のかたち","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"25","start":190.57,"end":194.41,"text":"その夢に目覚めたとき","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"26","start":194.41,"end":198.28,"text":"誰よりも光を放つ","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"27","start":198.28,"end":202.05,"text":"少年よ 神話になれ","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"28","start":202.05,"end":208.91,"text":"人は愛をつむぎながら歴史をつくる","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"29","start":208.91,"end":216.82999999999998,"text":"女神なんてなれないまま 私は生きる","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"30","start":216.82999999999998,"end":220.61,"text":"残酷な天使のテーゼ","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"31","start":220.61,"end":224.37,"text":"窓辺からやがて飛び立つ","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"32","start":224.37,"end":228.09,"text":"ほとばしる熱いパトスで","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"33","start":228.09,"end":232.09,"text":"思い出を裏切るなら","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"34","start":232.09,"end":235.59,"text":"この宇宙を抱いて輝く","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"35","start":235.59,"end":238.95,"text":"少年よ 神話になれ","translation":"","kind":"lyric"}],"candidates":[]}